xplain luffy's  almost superhuman vitality another  subtle nod to dragon's own strength  we could also speculate about monkey d  dragon's possible devil fruit as well  there's reason to believe that he has a  wind-based logia fruit or a more  generally weather based power  the wind examples are most obvious when  he steps in to save luffy from smoker  there are suddenly huge gusts of wind  that spread throughout the town and even  shatter rock  these gusts of wind help luffy escape  then during chapter 587  in a flashback when luffy and ace are  surrounded by flames  suddenly a path is opened up leading to  the revolutionary ship  the too good to be true path could have  been easily created with the help of  dragon's powerful gusts of wind  then during chapter 794 we see dragon  grab sabo's hand  after the ladders shipwreck and then he  later appears on his own revolutionary  ship  being told he's late and we can see what  looks like wind coming off of him  the ability to turn into wind and  transport using wind explains how he  could suddenly swoop in to save sabo so  quickly  and it would explain why trying to  capture him is so difficult if not  pointless because he could use his  powers to escape from practically every  situation however we've also seen  rain accompany dragon and specifically  it's hard to believe that the lightning  that saved luffy from his execution was  a coincidence  especially since dragon was present so  rather than just a straightforward wind  logia fruit as i mentioned there are  theories they could have a more general  weather weather fruit and there are also  theories that he could have a well  dragon fruit to match his name  specifically it could be a mythical zone  of a type of eastern  air dragon called a weatherlord  weatherlords are said to control the  weather  clouds and winds and bring life-giving  rain to the land  that last part sounds especially fitting  for a revolutionary they can also summon  a storm  when angered and ke